# REST

## 1.Admin
### 1.1 Login
POST http://localhost:1337/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "rememberMe": false
}


### 1.2 Register
POST http://localhost:1337/admin/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname": "",
    "lastname": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}


### 1.3 Forget Password
POST http://localhost:1337/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}


### 1.4 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:1337/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "password": "",
    "passwordConfirmation": "",
    "code": "RESET_PASSWORD_CODE_FROM_EMAIL"
}


### 1.5 Profile
GET http://localhost:1337/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

## 2.User
### 2.1 Login (User)
POST http://localhost:1337/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "",
    "password": ""
}

### 2.2 register (User) one time for first time
POST http://localhost:1337/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}

### 2.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:1337/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}


### 2.4 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:1337/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "password": "",
    "passwordConfirmation": "",
    "code": "RESET_PASSWORD_CODE_FROM_EMAIL"
}

### 2.5 Profile
GET http://localhost:1337/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json